  "summary": "Durable vector retrieval with HNSW and flat indexes. Typed persistent agent episodes, skills, causal edges, sessions and witness logs. Boundaries: Nested packages and scoped instructions are not exhaustively inventoried. Root npm package is marked private and is a workspace descriptor, not a verified publication version. Cargo root explicitly excludes components that do not build or have separate workspaces.",
